# Agent edit surface

- Prefer symbol search, grep, and targeted reads over opening whole files.
- Prefer editing `writing_rag/<boundary>/`; plan logic lives in `writing_rag/plan/`.
- Do not open hub scripts unless the task names them:
  `scripts/run_pipeline.py`.
- `scripts/article_plan.py`, `scripts/source_hydration.py`,
  `scripts/narrative_reconstruction.py`, `scripts/generate.py`,
  `scripts/paragraph_generation.py`, `scripts/paragraph_stages.py`,
  `scripts/generation_calls.py`, `scripts/evidence_trace.py`,
  `scripts/build_markdown_content.py`, `scripts/causal_probability.py`,
  and other `scripts/extract_*` / `scripts/create_*` / `scripts/build_*`
  ingest doorbells are compatibility shims only.
- Edit the smallest module that owns the behavior; do not refactor neighbors.
- Do not grow retrieve/plan/select/generate/verify policy in `scripts/`.
- Thin experiment entries in `scripts/` are allowed (doorbell); logic belongs in `writing_rag/`.
- For model-role policy, follow the glob rule matching the files you edit.
- For experiment history and metrics, use `docs/architecture/experiment-ledger.md`.
